                      },
                      "target_proposition_as_characterized": "A liquidated-damages clause is enforceable when it is a genuine pre-estimate of loss rather than a penalty."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "question": "Was 388 entitled to the return of its $100,000 deposit?",
          "answers": [
            {
              "answer": "Yes. Because 083 breached and could not transfer title, it had no claim to the deposit.",
